{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV全新飲食節目《收夜的美食家》逢星期一至五晚上10時30分播映。俗語有云「宵夜係自願，收夜係被迫」，節 …</p><p></p>\n<p>ViuTV全新飲食節目《收夜的美食家》逢星期一至五晚上10時30分播映。俗語有云「宵夜係自願，收夜係被迫」，節目由兩位新生代唱將Jacky Fan與Arvin化身深夜美食家，走訪香港各區晚上9時後仍然營業的特色食肆，為一眾日夜營營役役的「香港社畜」尋找放工後的最佳慰藉。昨晚（23日）播出的第一集《居酒屋微醺夜》中，Jacky Fan與Arvin來到一間日式居酒屋放鬆，期間「巧遇」老友Sica（何洛瑤）。三人面對滿枱的火炙刺身、豚肉提子串燒及牛舌等美食，食到停不了口。酒過三巡，Jacky Fan問起大家入行後，外出用餐會否因為藝人身份而多了顧慮，話題隨即轉到眾人的私下生活。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>即興開金口獻唱 老闆大談香港人辛酸</strong></b></h2>\n<p>除了大談心底話，Jacky Fan與Arvin更在居酒屋內即興獻唱，與現場食客打成一片，氣氛推至頂點。居酒屋老闆看到眾人玩得盡興，亦忍不住分享經營夜間食肆的感受：「依家生活太辛苦啦，當我哋企喺呢度同客人飲酒嘅時候，好多客人都會係有佢嘅唔開心啦，啊，經濟環境唔好啦，可能會有好多佢哋嘅問題啦，但係呢，佢哋會飲下飲下之後呢，佢就會覺得，哦，原來人生係可以放鬆下㗎喎，咁呢件係一件幾好嘅事嚟嘅。」三人聽後深表認同，認為香港人生活壓抑，無論是打工仔還是藝人，都需要一個喘息的空間。最後眾人舉杯，敬所有在壓抑環境下努力生活的香港人，寄語大家最緊要自己開心，享受生活！</p>\n<h2><b><strong>Arvin極抗拒「貼地」標籤：我都係普通人</strong></b></h2>\n<p>被問到出街食飯會否避忌，Arvin笑言自己知名度不高，完全沒有顧慮。當Jacky Fan形容他為人「貼地」時，Arvin即刻耍手擰頭，直言非常抗拒這個詞語，他回應：「其實我好忌諱『貼地』呢個字，我心諗我都係普通人咋嘛，即係你係搭地鐵、搭巴士返工，我都係㗎啫！」相反，Jacky Fan坦言入行後多了一份無形的心理包袱：「入咗行即係其實我哋自己都有個心態，就覺得我哋係artist唔可以做錯嘢，驚少少出錯會畀人放大，所以更加驚好多人眼望住我。」不過Arvin就表示自己已經放下這個包袱，認為藝人也是人，偶爾講錯說話或聲量太大都很正常。</p>\n<h2>Sica<b><strong>自爆曾遭食客投訴 化身美食KOL瘋狂搶Fo</strong></b></h2>\n<p>向來真性情的「主席」Sica亦非常認同Arvin的看法，認為藝人也應有自己的生活空間。她更自爆曾因聲量問題惹來微言：「我身邊有啲人好忌諱喺Bar度飲酒畀人認到，但我都係照唔戴帽去。最多，我試過同朋友喺餐廳傾偈太大聲畀人投訴嘅！」引來全場爆笑。節目中，Sica更發揮其搞笑本色，食到極品牛舌時突然「美食KOL」上身，對住鏡頭瘋狂拉客：「我覺得呢個牛舌，我決定要share晒畀我身邊嘅好朋友！如果你想知道呢個牛舌喺邊度可以食到呢，你留言『牛舌』！我已經整合咗全國嘅牛舌地圖！」逼得Jacky Fan和Arvin只能無奈配合，笑指觀眾如果不留言就吃不到這麼好吃的牛舌，場面惹笑。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚Sica不造作盡顯真性情一面</h2>\n<p>節目首播後隨即引發大批網民熱烈討論，不少觀眾對於三位藝人展現真性情感到驚喜。有網民留言表示「估唔到佢哋私底下傾偈咁放得開」，認為這種未經修飾與坦誠相見極具吸引力。亦有觀眾針對藝人壓力話題發表意見，指「做幕前真係慘，食餐飯都要就住就住」，並大讚Arvin心態健康。部分打工仔更被居酒屋老闆一席話觸動，紛紛於各大社交平台留言「香港社畜真係好需要呢啲小店回血」。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954496047616880_13028303926b0463053204a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 新生代唱將Jacky Fan與Arvin化身深夜美食家，走訪香港各區晚上9時後仍然營業的特色食肆，今集嘉賓為Sica，三人相聚好啱key。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954496047616880_13028303926b0463053204a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>新生代唱將Jacky Fan與Arvin化身深夜美食家，走訪香港各區晚上9時後仍然營業的特色食肆，今集嘉賓為Sica，三人相聚好啱key。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544960650561973_1743001286b04630790cf7.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 Sica食串燒牛舌，扮foodie銷牛舌：「我條脷已經同牛舌融為一體嘞！」（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544960650561973_1743001286b04630790cf7.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Sica食串燒牛舌，扮foodie銷牛舌：「我條脷已經同牛舌融為一體嘞！」（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544962067878528_20533258576b046315dea20.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 三人邊食邊傾，玩得好投契。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544962067878528_20533258576b046315dea20.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>三人邊食邊傾，玩得好投契。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544962963876747_18880727406b04631e2f560.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 向來真性情的「主席」sica亦非常認同Arvin的看法，認為藝人也應有自己的生活空間。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544962963876747_18880727406b04631e2f560.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>向來真性情的「主席」sica亦非常認同Arvin的看法，認為藝人也應有自己的生活空間。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544963134025912_6263415156b046320416b3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 居酒屋老闆看到眾人玩得盡興，亦忍不住分享經營夜間食肆的感受。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544963134025912_6263415156b046320416b3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>居酒屋老闆看到眾人玩得盡興，亦忍不住分享經營夜間食肆的感受。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544963397914623_13331588036b0463225d1e3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 Jacky Fan與Arvin更在居酒屋內即興獻唱，與現場食客打成一片。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544963397914623_13331588036b0463225d1e3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Jacky Fan與Arvin更在居酒屋內即興獻唱，與現場食客打成一片。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544963824366034_2913530116b046326d49db.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 Jacky Fan坦言入行後多了一份無形的心理包袱：「入咗行即係其實我哋自己都有個心態，就覺得我哋係artist唔可以做錯嘢，驚少少出錯會畀人放大。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544963824366034_2913530116b046326d49db.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Jacky Fan坦言入行後多了一份無形的心理包袱：「入咗行即係其實我哋自己都有個心態，就覺得我哋係artist唔可以做錯嘢，驚少少出錯會畀人放大。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544964031047917_6809618256b046328ad99c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 芥末鰈魚邊漬（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544964031047917_6809618256b046328ad99c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>芥末鰈魚邊漬（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544964496863019_21140671776b04632d711b9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 蟹籽野菜沙律（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544964496863019_21140671776b04632d711b9.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>蟹籽野菜沙律（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544965079620415_14159692086b046333402fa.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 火炙刺身他他（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544965079620415_14159692086b046333402fa.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>火炙刺身他他（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544965800317824_19147624186b04633a95ed9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 目仁奈刺身（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544965800317824_19147624186b04633a95ed9.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>目仁奈刺身（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544966430624752_11861845136b04634111b95.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 稻草燒鯖魚（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544966430624752_11861845136b04634111b95.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>稻草燒鯖魚（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544967077162998_147441476b04634722d73.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"收夜的美食家 何洛瑤 檸檬鴨肉凍湯烏冬（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179544967077162998_147441476b04634722d73.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>檸檬鴨肉凍湯烏冬（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bd%95%e6%b4%9b%e7%91%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">何洛瑤</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%94%b6%e5%a4%9c%e7%9a%84%e7%be%8e%e9%a3%9f%e5%ae%b6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">收夜的美食家</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%8c%83%e5%8d%93%e8%b3%a2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">范卓賢</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：ViuTV資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3548953\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T17:18:13.705423+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2276,"images":13,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T16:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T17:31:56.549353+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T17:11:40.898691+00:00","content_hash":"1a2e9d05e13761b427b15b50fe68e323e7098e234e40ded8448c80c07408cac9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}